<title>INDIA: INDIA-Ceat quotes on government securities-Mar 31.</title>
<headline>INDIA-Ceat quotes on government securities-Mar 31.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceat Financial Services said it</p>
<p>made the following two-way quotes on Monday for dated Government</p>
<p>securities and treasury bills</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Government securities</p>
<p>---------------------</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Particulars		    Bid/Offer	 Ytm(%)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>13.65% 2007		 100.65/100.85    13.59/13.55</p>
<p>13.85% 2006A		101.75/101.95    13.57/13.53</p>
<p>14.00% 2006		 102.55/102.85    13.51/13.45</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>* Quotes are available from CFSLs dealing room in Mumbai, at the telephone nos. 2886433 &amp; 2851131.</p>
